#: templates/website/about.html:98
msgid ""
"LIMIT Connect je ERP platforma nove generacije za mala i srednja poduzeća. "
"Razvijamo alate koji vam omogućuju da se fokusirate na ono što je važno — "
"vaš posao."
msgstr "LIMIT Connect is a next-generation ERP platform for small and medium-sized businesses. We develop tools that enable you to focus on what matters — your business."

#: templates/website/about.html:102
#| msgid "Moduli"
msgid "Modula"
msgstr "Modules"

#: templates/website/about.html:103
#| msgid "Potpuna automatizacija"
msgid "Potpuna lokalizacija"
msgstr "Full automation"

#: templates/website/about.html:104
#| msgid "Osnovno"
msgid "Osnovano"
msgstr "Basic"

#: templates/website/about.html:105
msgid "Cloud hosting"
msgstr "Cloud hosting"

#: templates/website/about.html:109
msgid "Naša priča"
msgstr "Our story"

#: templates/website/about.html:110
msgid ""
"LIMIT Connect nastao je iz jednostavne frustracije: postojeći ERP sustavi su "
"preskupi, prekomplicirani i ne razumiju lokalno tržište. Obrtnik u Slavoniji "
"i restoran u Münchenu imaju iste probleme — previše papira, previše klikova, "
"premalo vremena."
msgstr "LIMIT Connect was born from a simple frustration: existing ERP systems are too expensive, too complicated, and don't understand the local market. A craftsman in Slavonia and a restaurant in Munich have the same problems — too much paperwork, too many clicks, too little time."

#: templates/website/about.html:111
msgid ""
"Zato smo izgradili platformu koja spaja hrvatsku preciznost s njemačkom "
"temeljitošću. Fiskalizacija, e-Račun, POS blagajna, skladište, radni sati, "
"AI asistent — sve u jednom sustavu, s jednim pristupom."
msgstr "That's why we built a platform that combines Croatian precision with German thoroughness. Fiscalization, e-Invoice, POS cash register, warehouse, working hours, AI assistant — all in one system, with one access."

#: templates/website/about.html:112
msgid ""
"Naš cilj je jasan: dati malim poduzećima alate koje si dosad mogao priuštiti "
"samo koncern."
msgstr "Our goal is clear: give small businesses the tools that only large corporations could afford before."

#: templates/website/about.html:116
#| msgid "Zadane vrijednosti"
msgid "Naše vrijednosti"
msgstr "Default values"

#: templates/website/about.html:120
#| msgid "Jednostavno"
msgid "Jednostavnost"
msgstr "Simply"

#: templates/website/about.html:121
msgid ""
"Svaka funkcija mora biti razumljiva u 10 sekundi. Ako trebate priručnik, "
"napravili smo nešto krivo."
msgstr "Every feature must be understandable in 10 seconds. If you need a manual, we did something wrong."

#: templates/website/about.html:125
#| msgid "Transparentno poslovanje"
msgid "Transparentnost"
msgstr "Transparent business"

#: templates/website/about.html:126
msgid ""
"Bez skrivenih troškova, bez vendor lock-ina. Vaši podaci su vaši — uvijek, "
"bez iznimke."
msgstr "No hidden fees, no vendor lock-in. Your data is yours — always, without exception."

#: templates/website/about.html:131
msgid ""
"Ne samo prijevod, nego potpuna adaptacija — porezni sustav, e-Račun, "
"fiskalizacija, računovodstveni okviri za HR i DE tržište."
msgstr "Not just translation, but full adaptation — tax system, e-Invoice, fiscalization, accounting frameworks for the HR and DE market."

#: templates/website/about.html:135
msgid "Digitalno = zeleno"
msgstr "Digital = green"

#: templates/website/about.html:136
msgid ""
"Svaka faktura u oblaku je jedno drvo manje. Digitalizacija nije samo "
"praktična — ona je odgovorna."
msgstr "Every invoice in the cloud is one less tree. Digitalization is not just practical — it's responsible."

#: templates/website/about.html:142
#| msgid "Tip"
msgid "Tim"
msgstr "Type"

#: templates/website/about.html:148
msgid ""
"Full-stack inženjer s iskustvom u enterprise sustavima. Vizionar platforme."
msgstr "Full-stack engineer with enterprise systems experience. Platform visionary."

#: templates/website/about.html:154
msgid ""
"Vodi operacije, financije i odnose s klijentima. Brine da sve funkcionira."
msgstr "Leads operations, finance, and client relationships. Ensures everything works."

#: templates/website/about.html:160
msgid ""
"Naš AI asistent koji automatizira rutinske zadatke i pomaže korisnicima 24/7."
msgstr "Our AI assistant that automates routine tasks and supports users 24/7."

#: templates/website/about.html:166
msgid "Tehnologija"
msgstr "Technology"

#: templates/website/about.html:167
msgid ""
"Platforma je izgrađena na provjerenim tehnologijama: Django, PostgreSQL, "
"Redis, Celery. Hosting je na EU serverima (Hetzner, Njemačka) s automatskim "
"backupima i SSL enkripcijom."
msgstr "The platform is built on proven technologies: Django, PostgreSQL, Redis, Celery. Hosting is on EU servers (Hetzner, Germany) with automatic backups and SSL encryption."

#: templates/website/about.html:168
msgid "GDPR compliant od prvog dana. Vaši podaci nikad ne napuštaju EU."
msgstr "GDPR compliant from day one. Your data never leaves the EU."

